Expanded story:
Morning light spills across the kitchen as Amy slices eggs for Will and Amber’s toast, humming a lullaby while flipping pancakes on the stove. A sudden groan cracks through the front door; a zombie shuffles in, its eyes glazed with hunger. She grabs Will’s hand, pushes Amber into the closet, and hurries them to the basement stairs. Amy returns to the kitchen, wiping sweat from her brow as she flips another pancake. In a hidden drawer beneath the fridge, she pulls out a pistol and a gleaming katana, both bristling with dust. The zombie lunges; Amy fires the pistol, then slashes with the katana—one by one each undead falls as more surge from the hallway. With the last groaning body crumpled to the floorboards, she strides back up the stairs and opens the basement door. Will’s eyes widen; Amber squeals in relief as Amy pulls them both out into her arms, breathing heavy but alive.
